# Dragons EVO -- PUBLIC first-download repo (dragons-evo-client).
#
# This is where a player gets the client the first time. It tracks the exes
# (DragonsEVO_*.exe, ~15-20 MB each) and the DLLs; data.zip rides in the GitHub Release (below).
# It is generated by tools/client-release/build_client_release.py. There is NO loose client tree
# and NO signed manifest here (those live in the private updater repo).

# --- secrets / source: must never be here ---
/src/
resourcecryptkey.h
antibotsecret.h
*.cpp
*.vcxproj
*.vcxproj.*
*.sln
*.props
*.pem
*.key
.env
.env.*
*.pdb

# --- data.zip (~171 MB: the encrypted client + data/things, whose Tibia.spr alone is ~128 MB) exceeds
#     GitHub's 100 MB per-file push limit, so it is NOT in git: build_client_release.py publishes it
#     as the asset of the GitHub Release "client-<release>". Players get the exe/DLLs from here and
#     data.zip from Releases (or from the site's download/ folder, which updatefiles.sh fills). ---
data.zip

# --- the client's log when you run it from this folder to test (DragonsEVO.log) ---
/*.log

# --- build scratch ---
.stage-client-release/
*.tmp

# --- OS / editor junk ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
